    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V7bqBjXzf44\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/V7bqBjXzf44/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/the-agentic-economy-is-way-bigger-than-you-think-xen-baynham-herd-V7bqBjXzf44.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/the-agentic-economy-is-way-bigger-than-you-think-xen-baynham-herd\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Agentic Economy Is WAY Bigger Than You Think | Xen Baynham-Herd</a></p>\n<p>Tokenized stocks on Base grabbed about a third of weekly spot trading in their market just months after launch, and Xen Baynham-Herd, Director of Marketing and Global Expansion at Base, says that's only the start.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/the-agentic-economy-is-way-bigger-than-you-think-xen-baynham-herd\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Agentic Economy Is WAY Bigger Than You Think | Xen Baynham-Herd</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
