    "title": "Bitcoin Has Become Boring, Finally",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/culture/bitcoin-has-become-boring-finally",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/boringbitcoin-scaled.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/culture/bitcoin-has-become-boring-finally\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Has Become Boring, Finally</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin isn't a shiny new technology any more, it is established, and it is here to stay. </p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/culture/bitcoin-has-become-boring-finally\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Has Become Boring, Finally</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/roy-sheinfeld\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roy Sheinfeld</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/boringbitcoin-scaled.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/culture/bitcoin-has-become-boring-finally\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Has Become Boring, Finally</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin isn't a shiny new technology any more, it is established, and it is here to stay. </p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/culture/bitcoin-has-become-boring-finally\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Has Become Boring, Finally</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/roy-sheinfeld\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roy Sheinfeld</a>.</p>",
