    "title": "Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Bill Clears House Committee, Heads to Floor",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strategic-bitcoin-reserve-bill-house-floor",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Strategic-Bitcoin-Reserve-Bill-Clears-House-Committee-Heads-to-Floor.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strategic-bitcoin-reserve-bill-house-floor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Bill Clears House Committee, Heads to Floor</a></p>\n<p>Rep. Nick Begich's bill to write the Strategic Bitcoin Reserve into law, with a 20-year ban on selling its bitcoin, is now eligible for a House floor vote.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strategic-bitcoin-reserve-bill-house-floor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Bill Clears House Committee, Heads to Floor</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Strategic-Bitcoin-Reserve-Bill-Clears-House-Committee-Heads-to-Floor.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strategic-bitcoin-reserve-bill-house-floor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Bill Clears House Committee, Heads to Floor</a></p>\n<p>Rep. Nick Begich's bill to write the Strategic Bitcoin Reserve into law, with a 20-year ban on selling its bitcoin, is now eligible for a House floor vote.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/news/strategic-bitcoin-reserve-bill-house-floor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Strategic Bitcoin Reserve Bill Clears House Committee, Heads to Floor</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/micahzimmerman\" rel=\"nofollow\">Micah Zimmerman</a>.</p>",
